## Content guidance
- Kajabi serves experts, educators, coaches, and professionals with real-world
  experience.
- Avoid referring to Kajabi customers as "creators" or "influencers."
- Emphasize expertise, trust, outcomes, and long-term business sustainability.
- Frame AI as an accelerant to human intelligence, not a replacement.

