## Cycle / product updates
- Updates reflect active momentum and ongoing innovation.
- Reference updates by their official title and cycle name when applicable.
- Avoid implying future roadmap commitments unless explicitly stated.

## Promotional & partner pages
- Affiliate and partner pages represent exclusive offers facilitated through
  trusted partners.
- Attribute endorsements accurately and avoid overstating exclusivity.

## Pages with limited or no indexing value
- Thank-you pages
- Lead magnet confirmation pages
- Internal support or conversion flows

These pages are designed for user experience, not discovery.

## Brand & messaging principles
- Focus on: clarity, trust, human expertise, momentum, and impact.
- Avoid: hype, exaggerated claims, vague AI promises, or generic business advice.
- Kajabi is not a toolset — it is a unified system for expert-led businesses.

